         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">FQB12P20 - MOSFET â€“ Pâ€Channel, QFET -200 V, -11.5 A, 470 mÎ©</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:creator>
            <rdf:Seq>
               <rdf:li>onsemi</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Seq>
         </dc:creator>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">These Pâ€Channel enhancement mode power field effect transistors are produced using onsemi's proprietary, planar stripe, DMOS technology.&#xA;This advanced technology has been especially tailored to minimize onâ€state resistance, provide superior switching performance, and withstand high energy pulse in the avalanche and commutation mode. These devices are well suited for high efficiency switching DC/DC converters.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
